MATRIX: Bubble sort. PUT returns a new garage with one index replaced.

ESCAPE THE MATRIX

HUSTLE swap WITH row AND i AND j
  BUGATTI left EQUALS CALL at (row, i)
  BUGATTI right EQUALS CALL at (row, j)
  BUGATTI row EQUALS CALL put (row, i, right)
  CASH OUT CALL put (row, j, left)
DONE HUSTLING

HUSTLE bubble WITH row
  BUGATTI n EQUALS CALL length WITH row
  BUGATTI i EQUALS 0
  GRIND WHILE i IS LESS THAN n
    BUGATTI j EQUALS 0
    GRIND WHILE j IS LESS THAN n MINUS i MINUS 1
      IF CALL at (row, j) IS GREATER THAN CALL at (row, j PLUS 1) THEN
        BUGATTI row EQUALS CALL swap (row, j, j PLUS 1)
      PERIOD
      BUGATTI j EQUALS j PLUS 1
    STOP GRINDING
    BUGATTI i EQUALS i PLUS 1
  STOP GRINDING
  CASH OUT row
DONE HUSTLING

WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL bubble WITH [5, 1, 4, 2, 8, 0]
WHAT COLOR IS YOUR BUGATTI CALL bubble WITH [3, 3, 1]

